$ rtok filter --help
Filter text from stdin without executing

Usage: rtok filter [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>  User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --stdin          Read the payload from stdin (OpenCode `tool.execute.after`)
