  -h, --help           Print help

$ rtok expand --help
Print an archived payload

Usage: rtok expand [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  

Options:
      --config <PATH>      User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --lines <LINES>      Inclusive 1-based range `a-b`
      --grep <GREP>        Regex filter (literal when it does not compile); hits print as `N:line`
      --context <CONTEXT>  With `--grep`: N lines around each hit, overlapping windows merged with
                           `--`
  -h, --help               Print help

